Linework bundles parts of draw.io (https://github.com/jgraph/drawio) in
assets/drawio: the diagram runtime, editor, shape libraries and libavoid
router. draw.io is Copyright (c) JGraph Ltd and licensed under the Apache
License 2.0; see assets/drawio/LICENSE. libavoid-js is LGPL-2.1; see
assets/drawio/js/libavoid-js/LICENSE. The bundled version is in
assets/drawio/VERSION.

Linework bundles three fonts in assets/fonts, all under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1: IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono (Copyright IBM Corp.) and
Kalam (Copyright Indian Type Foundry). The license text for each is next to its files. linework
embeds subsets of them in the SVGs it writes, which the license allows.
